{"id":"SC4-L","book":true,"type":"Listening","title":"Listening – Test 4","source":"Succeed in B1 Preliminary · Test 4","set":"Succeed in B1 Preliminary","minutes":0,"audio":"audio/SC4.mp3","duration":1825,"count":25,"parts":[{"title":"Part 1","nums":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"built":true,"questions":"<p class=\"inst\"><i>For each question, choose the correct answer.</i></p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q1\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">1</span> What time will they meet?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"1\" id=\"a1\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L1A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L1B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L1C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q2\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">2</span> Where is the girl’s diary?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"2\" id=\"a2\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L2A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L2B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L2C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q3\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">3</span> What is not open on Monday?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"3\" id=\"a3\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L3A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L3B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L3C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q4\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">4</span> What will the woman have?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"4\" id=\"a4\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L4A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L4B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L4C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q5\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">5</span> Where did the man go on Saturday?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"5\" id=\"a5\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L5A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L5B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L5C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q6\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">6</span> What will the man buy for his brother?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"6\" id=\"a6\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L6A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L6B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L6C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q7\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">7</span> How will most people travel to work tomorrow?</div><div class=\"opts pics\" data-n=\"7\" id=\"a7\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L7A.png\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>A</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L7B.png\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>B</b></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><img src=\"img/SC4_L7C.png\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"><b>C</b></button></div></div>"},{"title":"Part 2","nums":[8,9,10,11,12,13],"built":true,"questions":"<p class=\"inst\"><i>For each question, choose the correct answer.</i></p><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear two friends talking about going on holiday.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q8\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">8</span> What does the boy like most?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"8\" id=\"a8\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>travelling</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>freedom</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>nice beaches</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear two friends talking about extra school courses.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q9\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">9</span> They agree that</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"9\" id=\"a9\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>the course must interest them.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>the course must help their career.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>the course must be about computers.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a boy talking about a waterskiing weekend.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q10\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">10</span> How did he feel about it?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"10\" id=\"a10\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>satisfied with himself</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>hopeful of going again</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>not very confident</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You hear two friends talking about a book they are reading.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q11\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">11</span> They agree that</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"11\" id=\"a11\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>it’s boring.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>it’s confusing.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>it’s a good choice.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear two friends talking about clothes.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q12\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">12</span> The boy advises the girl to</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"12\" id=\"a12\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>buy the two pairs.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>get the black ones.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>get the colour she prefers.</span></button></div></div><p class=\"ctx\">You hear two friends talking about mountain bikes.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q13\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">13</span> They agree that</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"13\" id=\"a13\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>the sport needs little equipment.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>a quality bicycle is essential.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>mountain biking is the most expensive sport.</span></button></div></div>"},{"title":"Part 3","nums":[14,15,16,17,18,19],"built":true,"questions":"<p class=\"inst\"><i>For each question, write the correct answer in the gap. Write one or two words or a number or a date or a time.</i></p><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a woman talking about tours of historic houses in the south of England.</p><div class=\"pbox\"><h3 class=\"ptitle\">Historic Tours</h3><p><b>South Elmham House</b></p><p>It was built around the 1300s, but it was greatly improved in the <span class=\"qn-b\">14</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"14\" id=\"a14\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"14\"> .</p><p>It must have been the home of a <span class=\"qn-b\">15</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"15\" id=\"a15\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"15\"> , as its wall paintings suggest.</p><p><b>Haughley Hall</b></p><p>One of its best features is the secret <span class=\"qn-b\">16</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"16\" id=\"a16\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"16\"> .</p><p>Tours take place at 11.30 and 2 pm and are £15 with a <span class=\"qn-b\">17</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"17\" id=\"a17\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"17\"> or £12 with tea.</p><p><b>Bedfield House</b></p><p>Gardens are joined by <span class=\"qn-b\">18</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"18\" id=\"a18\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"18\"> .</p><p>Tours start at 10.30 and 2.30 and one has to pay £ <span class=\"qn-b\">19</span><input class=\"ans\" data-n=\"19\" id=\"a19\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"next\" placeholder=\"19\"> .</p></div>"},{"title":"Part 4","nums":[20,21,22,23,24,25],"built":true,"questions":"<p class=\"inst\"><i>For each question, choose the correct answer.</i></p><p class=\"ctx\">You will hear a radio interview with a young clothes designer called Sally.</p><div class=\"q\" id=\"q20\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">20</span> What did Sally want to do when she was 19?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"20\" id=\"a20\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>become a cartoonist</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>be a successful artist</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>work as a fashion designer</span></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q21\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">21</span> Why couldn’t Sally sell her paintings?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"21\" id=\"a21\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>Only people close to her enjoyed them.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>She didn’t have enough time to make any good ones.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>Not enough people saw them.</span></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q22\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">22</span> While working at the clothes shop Sally</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"22\" id=\"a22\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>realised she needed a change of career.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>decided to change her style completely.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>gained some useful knowledge.</span></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q23\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">23</span> How did Sally first start as a designer?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"23\" id=\"a23\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>She began designing for fun.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>She knew the right people to help her out.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>Her boss asked her to make some designs.</span></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q24\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">24</span> How does Sally feel about designing clothes for men?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"24\" id=\"a24\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>She has mixed feelings.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>She is not very interested.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>She is very worried.</span></button></div></div><div class=\"q\" id=\"q25\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"qn-b\">25</span> What does Sally like most about being a designer?</div><div class=\"opts\" data-n=\"25\" id=\"a25\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"A\"><b>A</b><span>getting lots of new clothes</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"B\"><b>B</b><span>seeing her designs in the shops</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"C\"><b>C</b><span>earning a high salary</span></button></div></div>"}]}